OL,3,GNEWSAFirms affected by shop fire may
OL,4,Areopen within days
OL,5,
OL,6,FBedfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid businesses affected by a blaze at
OL,8,Fa bathroom showroom could be allowed
OL,9,Fback into their premises in the coming
OL,10,Fdays.
OL,12,FAt its peak, about 70 firefighters were
OL,13,Ftackling the fire in Selbourne Road,
OL,14,FLuton, which broke out at the Kitchen
OL,15,Fand Bathroom Store on Saturday.
OL,17,FIt was extinguished but the site
OL,18,Fremained cordoned off while
OL,19,Finvestigators worked to establish the
OL,20,Fcause.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
