OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirms affected by shop fire may
OL,4,Areopen within days
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Garrett, the service's head of
OL,7,Fprotection and response, said: "I
OL,8,Fanticipate it won't be more than a few
OL,9,Fdays, it won't go into weeks, and it
OL,10,Falso depends on Luton Borough Council's
OL,11,Fassessment of the safety of the
OL,12,Fstructure."
